## Commercial-Grade Priority

Current highest-value Nexus Link priorities:

1. Read-only commercial-grade repo audit
2. RaphaelCore eval harness
3. Raphael safety verifier
4. Raphael Core Lab
5. Mobile UI/HUD stabilization
6. Emotional habitat state integration
