Do not prioritize content expansion before the core AI loop is testable.

## Final Report Format

Every agent report must include:

1. Outcome
2. Files changed
3. What changed
4. What was verified
5. What was not verified
6. Risks / caveats
7. Rollback plan
8. Suggested next TASK_PACK
